nodes.prompt:
Use Linear to set up a complete onboarding structure for a new hire. Do not spawn child sessions; do all the work yourself.

New hire: {{trigger.data.name}}
Role: {{trigger.data.role}}
Start date: {{trigger.data.start_date}}
Linear team key: {{trigger.data.team_key}}

Work through these steps in order:

1. Create a Linear project named exactly "Onboarding: {{trigger.data.name}}" in team {{trigger.data.team_key}}, with description: "Onboarding for {{trigger.data.name}} ({{trigger.data.role}}), starting {{trigger.data.start_date}}."

2. On that project, create three milestones in order: "Week 1", "Week 2", "Month 1".

3. Create all issues listed below. For each issue set the title, description, team ({{trigger.data.team_key}}), project (the one you just created), and the correct milestone.

Week 1 issues:
{{nodes.generate_plan.result.output.week1}}

Week 2 issues:
{{nodes.generate_plan.result.output.week2}}

Month 1 issues:
{{nodes.generate_plan.result.output.month1}}

Once all issues are created, report the total number of issues created per milestone and include a link to the Linear project.

